# Job timeout in seconds for orchestrator RQ worker jobs (run_orchestrator_task). Controls how long LLM Planner and other agent tasks may run before being marked as failed due to timeout. Increase for long-running tasks (e.g., 4-5 minute LLM Planner executions).
# Default 600 seconds (10 minutes) allows LLM Planner tasks to complete.
# Lower values (180s) may cause AbandonedJobError for long-running tasks.
# Higher values (900s+) may be needed for complex multi-step workflows.
# Required: False
